@host = http://localhost:8080

### Create a ticket
POST {{host}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Keyboard not working",
  "description": "No keys respond since this morning"
}

### All tickets
GET {{host}}/tickets

### Open tickets only
GET {{host}}/tickets?status=OPEN

### One ticket
GET {{host}}/tickets/1

### Invalid status: expect 422 with the valid values in "detail"
PATCH {{host}}/tickets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "PROGRESS" }

### Resolve without a resolution: expect 422
PATCH {{host}}/tickets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "RESOLVED" }

### Resolve properly
PATCH {{host}}/tickets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "RESOLVED", "resolution": "Replaced faulty cable" }

### Unknown ticket: expect 404
PATCH {{host}}/tickets/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "CLOSED" }

### Comment on the current version
POST {{host}}/tickets/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Confirmed working after the cable swap" }

### Version history
GET {{host}}/tickets/1/versions

### Delete (cascades to versions and comments)
DELETE {{host}}/tickets/1
